        "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/extras/8902904f6781625410671d6d56216deb.avif?t=1757031681\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Sasaeng (사생): An obsessive fan who invades a celebrity’s private life, often following them excessively and disregarding personal boundaries.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are two endings. We recommend watching both endings. (Hint below)</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: <strong>About 1 ~ 1.5 hour</strong> for first-time players. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter save system</strong> supported.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Info</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/extras/82b1aff7c7c44a881a75f5208b933d22.avif?t=1757031681\" width=462 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The glamorous life of a K-POP idol, and the fanatical obsession and dark shadow lurking behind it. Watched by an unknown presence, who will you trust, and what will you doubt?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/extras/fb5fda05c8a4a9e3db4d02433526d213.avif?t=1757031681\" width=462 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your successful debut, you begin to feel an unknown gaze in your daily life. The attention you once believed was simple fan adoration turns into madness, now approaching as a threat that seems to see right through you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life of a K-pop Idol</strong>:<br>Experience a day in the life — fan letters, vocal training, fan sign events. But not everything goes well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Entertainment Agency</strong>:<br>Move freely through practice rooms, offices, staff café, and restrooms to uncover clues and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>:<br>A creeping sense of being watched builds tension through subtle detail and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Luxury Apartment with Secrets</strong>:<br>What once felt safe now seems strangely unfamiliar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong>:<br>There are 2 different endings based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - Move<br>Shift - Run<br>E - Interact<br>ESC - Options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ending Hint</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending #1. Find something in the kitchen to use as a weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending #2. Survive by holding out time</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Sasaeng (사생): An obsessive fan who invades a celebrity’s private life, often following them excessively and disregarding personal boundaries.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are two endings. We recommend watching both endings. (Hint below)</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: <strong>About 1 ~ 1.5 hour</strong> for first-time players. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter save system</strong> supported.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Info</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/extras/82b1aff7c7c44a881a75f5208b933d22.avif?t=1757031681\" width=462 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The glamorous life of a K-POP idol, and the fanatical obsession and dark shadow lurking behind it. Watched by an unknown presence, who will you trust, and what will you doubt?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/extras/fb5fda05c8a4a9e3db4d02433526d213.avif?t=1757031681\" width=462 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your successful debut, you begin to feel an unknown gaze in your daily life. The attention you once believed was simple fan adoration turns into madness, now approaching as a threat that seems to see right through you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life of a K-pop Idol</strong>:<br>Experience a day in the life — fan letters, vocal training, fan sign events. But not everything goes well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Entertainment Agency</strong>:<br>Move freely through practice rooms, offices, staff café, and restrooms to uncover clues and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>:<br>A creeping sense of being watched builds tension through subtle detail and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Luxury Apartment with Secrets</strong>:<br>What once felt safe now seems strangely unfamiliar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong>:<br>There are 2 different endings based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - Move<br>Shift - Run<br>E - Interact<br>ESC - Options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ending Hint</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending #1. Find something in the kitchen to use as a weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending #2. Survive by holding out time</p>",
